@startuml
title SSD - UC-09 - Productivity Analytics

autonumber
actor Learner
participant "FocusDesktop System" as System

Learner -> System : requestAnalytics(from, to)
System --> Learner : analytics(from, to, totalFocusSeconds, totalBreakSeconds, completedSessions, averageSessionSeconds, focusScore, bestDay)
System --> Learner : dailyBreakdown(date, focusSeconds, breakSeconds, completedSessions)

note right of System
  Explicit date bounds are inclusive local dates
  and limited to 366 days. With no bounds, totals
  cover all completed sessions and the daily
  breakdown covers the latest 7 local days.
  Focus score is actual work time / planned work
  time, rounded and clamped to 0..100. Distraction
  metrics are deferred until tracking exists.
  No data leaves the device.
end note

@enduml
